---
const calendarUrl = "https://calendar.app.google/VWp8SeE54z1jaqwR9";
---

<footer class="bg-neat-navy py-24 text-white text-center" id="footer-cta" role="contentinfo">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 font-title uppercase tracking-widest">
        <div class="flex justify-center items-center gap-4 mb-10 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tighter">
            <img src="/img/logos/neatcraft.svg" alt="Neatcraft Logo" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full"
                 onerror="this.style.display='none'">
            <span>NEATCRAFT</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl mb-10 leading-relaxed normal-case tracking-normal font-bold">
            J'aide les dirigeants de PME et ETI françaises à passer d'un SI qui les prend en otage<br/>
            <span class="text-neat-orange">à une trajectoire technologique qu'ils maîtrisent.</span>
        </h2>
        <a href={calendarUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
           class="inline-block bg-white text-neat-navy px-12 py-4 rounded-neat text-lg hover:bg-neat-orange hover:text-white transition-all mb-16 uppercase shadow-lg font-bold">
            PRENDRE RENDEZ-VOUS
        </a>
        <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-center gap-8 text-[10px] opacity-30 tracking-[0.2em]">
            <span>&copy; 2024 NEATCRAFT - Conseil Architecture & Stratégie SI</span>
            <nav aria-label="Liens légaux">
                <ul class="flex gap-8">
                    <li>
                        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jouana/" class="hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity font-bold">LinkedIn</a>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a href="/mentions-legales" class="hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity font-bold">Mentions Légales</a>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>
